    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At ALLWIN FOOD CO., LTD, we prioritize the safety and quality of our products by adhering to internationally recognized standards. Our dedication is reflected in the multiple certifications we have obtained, including ISO 22000, HACCP, and FSSC 22000. These certifications ensure that every stage of our production process meets stringent requirements for hygiene and quality.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
